here is my Makefile:
# KLH10 Makefile for OSF/1 (DU, Tru64) on Alpha
# $Id: Mk-nbsdaxp.mk,v 2.3a 2003/04/09 11:00:00 rms Exp $
#
#  Copyright <A9> 2001 Kenneth L. Harrenstien
#  Modified by by bob smith for DS10 build of KLH10
#  All Rights Reserved
