ISA-pcmcia wireless cards from Lucent(Proxim) work well in several
alpha's(164LX->PWS->AS1000) that i use. With the following kernel mod:
pcic0	at	isa? port 0x3e0 iomem 0xd0000 iosiz 0x10000
pcic1	at	isa? port 0x3e2 iomem 0xcc000 iosiz 0x4000
pcmcia*	at	pcic? controller ? socket ?
options PCIC_ISA_ALLOC_IOBASE=0x300
options PCIC_ISA_ALLOC_IOSIZE=0x0ff
an*	at      pcmcia? function ?		# Aironet PC4500/PC4800
wi*	at	pcmcia? function ?		# Lucent/Intersil/..
-Orinoco or Aironet pcmcia cards.
Also the aironet(cisco) 350 pci card works very well in 64 bit slots
Kernel file add :
an*	at pci? dev ? function ?	# Aironet PC4500/PC4800 (802.11)
-Mel






