ccd0: error 16 on component 1


and with a QLogic ISP1040B (don't ask me why it probes as a 1020):

isp0 at pci1 dev 10 function 0: QLogic 1020 Ultra Wide SCSI HBA
isp0: interrupting at dec 550 irq 20
